        },
        {
          "text": "Kïwö Yakopo Mamre wölo kimi kwanta Isak atolekïtö kanasyanta Kiryatarpa, nyoni kï Epron, kor nyo kimang Apraam nko Isak kïle pich cho le to. ",
          "type": "text",
