              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïrapas Isak akutuyö kegh nko kukötinechi ato kikikïyosit nyoman, kïtïp Esau nko Yakopo papongwa.",
          "type": "text",
